	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Lunchtime in the cafeteria.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, it's Elsa.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"As soon as we arrive, we spot Elsa on the television.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Two weeks have passed since our battle in the Republican occupation.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"In that short time, the Empire has undergone a truly dizzying amount of change.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"The day after Warren withdrew the bulk of his forces from the Empire, Elsa was appointed as the new governor-general.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"And on the same day, Empress Hisui abdicated her throne, leaving the governance of the Empire to be decided by a representative body elected by the people.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Elsa seems determined to move forward with transforming the Empire into a proper democracy.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I must say, I never imagined that we would be able to have back our peaceful school days.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You never realize how nice a simple school life was until\nit's gone.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Elsa's first order of business as governor-general was to enforce discipline within the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"All soldiers who committed crimes against the Imperial people were harshly disciplined.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"On top of that, all the warriors were granted a full executive pardon and exonerated of any wrongdoings.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We have Empress Hisui to thank for that.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You can say that again.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"From what I've heard, Kanami refused to cooperate with\nElsa's plans for democratization unless all the warriors were granted amnesty.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"We each fill up our plates with whatever we want and take our seats together.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Speaking of which, I hear that both Empress Hisui and Elsa-sama will be joining us here in the near future.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You'd better watch yourself, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You just might find yourself in the slammer if you spill another drink on her.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Seriously, spare us from having to visit you in prison.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Blublublublub...”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"We enjoy our light-hearted conversation as we watch the television.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Incidentally, Kotone and I recently celebrated our official union as man and wife.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"It was a small, quiet affair, involving only our closest friends including Akari, Hotori, Mutsumi-san, and the manager, still alive and well.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Still... Akari-sama, was this truly for the best?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You will no longer be able to claim your birthright as Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, that?”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Akari pauses for a moment, looking up from her anmitsu.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As long as the Empire is a place where the people can live in peace, I'm not so fussed about that.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's not like I wanted to be all-important or have everyone look up to me anyways.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Akari turns her attention towards Elsa on the television.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Right now, Elsa's laying the groundwork so that the Imperial people can determine their own future.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's all I was ever fighting for in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In which case, I figure I can just sit back and leave everything up to her.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course, that doesn't mean I trust her completely.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Akari declares, her eyes shining with an unwavering light.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So if things don't go the way you want, are you saying\nyou'll take matters into your own hands?”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If I can't persuade her with words alone, sure.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But I don't think it'll ever get to that point.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Rather than the Founding Empress's power, or Mitsurugi's strength, or the Sacred Treasures, we should settle our differences with arguments.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's what the spirit of democracy is all about, isn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Akari shows us a wide grin.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“At any rate, our days as swashbuckling outlaws are over and done with.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If we're ever unhappy with the direction the Empire is headed now, we can just run for office and fight for our ideas fair and square.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Keep your lofty ambitions, but don't make light of our struggles these past three years.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Hotori glumly glares at Akari.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So there you have it. After two thousand years of faithful service to the Empire, it looks like poor Mitsurugi's gonna be out of a job.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Still, Kotone sure was quick to snatch him right up before I even got the chance to give him the boot.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Gosh, I did no such thing!”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Though if you ever have need of Soujin-sama, I would be more than happy to loan him out─only for the most proprietous of services, of course!”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Gotcha, I'll keep it in mind.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, I'm not your personal possession.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"I'd prefer for her to stop talking openly about “loaning me out.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hmmm? I seem to remember a certain someone proudly calling himself nothing but his lord's tool...”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Why, I remember the exact same thing!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Akari and Kotone grin knowingly at each other.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I swear, some warrior you are... You go and get yourself hitched, and the next thing I know, you're totally whipped.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's not how I see it.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"But it is true that I'm unsure how to act towards Kotone now that we're man and wife.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"No matter what, though, I'll never change my mind about this one matter.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"─I'll do anything to protect Kotone's free-spirited, ever-cheerful smile.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Every time I see it, I can't help but think that it's the most beautiful thing about her.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Lost in my thoughts, I fail to notice Kotone until she's sidled up right next to me.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, Soujin-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's up?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“This ≪curry rice≫ dish is most delicious.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You absolutely must try some!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Say 'aah.'”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"She holds out a spoonful in front of my mouth.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No thanks, I'll pass. Republican cuisine isn't really to my taste.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, no, this truly is delicious!”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Say 'aah.'”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Er, like I said...”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Slowly backed into a corner, I turn to Akari for help.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Not gonna eat it?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nope.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How terrible, Soujin-sama... What an awful man I have gotten involved with...”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even after swearing your vows to me, you would refuse to perform this basic rite of all loving couples?!”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If this goes on any longer, it's divorce, I say!”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hold your horses. I have my likes and dislikes when it comes to food, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd like you to respect that.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Your wife is telling you it tastes great, you know? Do you really have such little faith in her?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mh...”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"At a loss for words, I look towards Hotori this time.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin... we're in the cafeteria, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're not gonna be so shameless that you let her spoonfeed you in front of the whole student body, are you?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's right, Kotone. We're in public.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd prefer not to embarrass ourselves while everyone's watching.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But that Republican couple over there is doing the exact same thing.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"I look over to find a Republican boy opening wide as his girlfriend affectionately feeds him.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"And they even share a kiss in between each bite.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“They're ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"what...?!",
{"/font"},
" Not on my watch!”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You mustn't, Hotori-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In their culture, an embrace or a touching of cheeks is apparently a standard greeting among acquaintances.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And I've heard it said that two lovers never greet each other with anything short of a kiss.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“H-How salacious!”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But... If it's their culture, does that mean I should respect it?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Hotori begins to agonize.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“With that said, Soujin-sama, it would be best if you ate up before it gets cold.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...We're seriously gonna do this?”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If you refuse, I shall be filing for divorce.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Say 'aah.'”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Oh, whatever. I suppose one bite won't kill me.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Plus, it'll be sure to make Kotone happy.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Nnmh?”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"As I slowly chew, I come to realize─",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hey, this is pretty good.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Just like your wife told you! Come on now, have another bite.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Say 'aah!'”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"I allow Kotone to feed me one bite of the ≪curry rice≫ after another.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"It's vaguely similar to meat and potato stew, though with an intriguing spiciness.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It seems you have taken quite the liking to it, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I could definitely eat this again.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Kotone proceeds to alternatingly feed me one spoonful and eat one herself.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, is this not delicious?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mhm, it sure is.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aaaaargh! I can't take it anymore!”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Akari inexplicably flies into a rage.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You two can have your fun, but try putting yourselves in the shoes of the audience who's forced to watch!”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"are",
{"/font"},
" a married couple, are we not? Whatever is the harm?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Miyaguni has a point.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This is a place of learning. We students should be expected to show some decorum.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, Inou! You tell 'em!”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Thanks to Akari and Hotori causing a scene, the entire cafeteria turns their attention upon us.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, Hotori-sama, are you intentionally trying to disrupt our lovely spousal intimacy?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We're telling you there's a proper time and place for that sorta thing!”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Well I should think that any time and place is the proper time and place! After all, a man and wife are enjoined by an eternal bond that transcends all!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Kotone's rejoinder only adds fuel to the fire, and the girls start bickering even louder.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Knock it off, you three. You're only making things worse.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Only after I chastise everyone does the commotion finally die down.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"After school lets out, Akari invites us to accompany her to the Imperial Tomb overlooking Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"After arriving in front of her mother's grave, Akari closes her eyes and puts her hands together in a silent prayer.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Kotone likewise pays her respects.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All done.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thanks for coming along with me, Soujin. Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh no, it was our pleasure.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What were you praying for?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Just wanted to give an update to my mother.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The winds of change are about to blow through the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It might not be what my mother had in mind, but I have faith that the Empire will be better for it.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So I just wanted to tell her that I'm gonna keep doing all I can for the Empire, and ask her to keep watching over me.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"At first, all Akari ever wanted was to slay Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"In time, her ambitions became to restore the Empire. And now, she aspires to do all she can to lead the Empire into a new age.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"But despite all she's been through, Akari remains the very same lord to whom I willingly swore my life, upon this very hill.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Would that I could always keep my eyes on the horizon as you do, Akari-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But I must confess, I am somewhat anxious about the future.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Kotone murmurs, turning her gaze towards the final resting place of countless Emperors past.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“For two thousand years, the Empire has endured and prospered as 'the realm under God's protection' under the benevolent and watchful gaze of its Emperors.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And we priestesses have always faithfully carried out the\nEmperor's will in the background through the use of our magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But now that the Imperial institution is coming to an end, whatever will become of us priestesses?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Until now, the priesthood has been an institution that existed solely to serve the Emperor.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"But all that is soon to change.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"And when it does, the role and duties of the Exalt-Priestess are sure to change as well.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, Elsa's the one running the show for now, but once elections take place, I think you'd serve the new president.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am not suggesting that I am opposed to that.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“However, we priestesses place our very lives on the line whenever we use our magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“When the time comes, would I truly be willing to lay down my life for such a person? I... still do not have my answer.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"I understand how Kotone feels. So long as the people will it, even the president could be switched out for someone else at any time.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"She is no longer able to serve just a single lord.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Elsa said she'd preserve the Empire's traditions and continue to respect the Emperor as the symbol of our sovereignty, remember?”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No matter who's actually in charge and how much that changes, the things we've always believed in─the things most important to us, they won't change so easily.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“They'll always remain in our hearts and be passed down from generation to generation.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't you think ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"that's",
{"/font"},
" what priestesses have always existed to protect?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"The things most precious to us.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"The things we want to protect with all our life.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"These things are rooted deeply in the hearts of all\nOomikami's children; that which has always given the Empire its shape.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"That which Oomikami's most faithful servants─the priestesses─have always cherished on our behalf.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Yes, you are right.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank you very much, Akari-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Because of you, I have no more doubts about what to do moving forward.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Kotone declares with a renewed vigor.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Her expression is so radiant, her eyes so bright, that their light must surely be capable of reaching Oomikami Himself.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah? Good for you.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But don't forget that we're still students for now, you hear?”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So let's make the most of it and enjoy our youth for all its worth!”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ehehee, count me in!”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"No matter how long and harsh winter is─",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"Beyond it, spring always comes around.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Looking forward to the day the Persica will once again blossom across the sprawling Tenkyo vista before us, the three of us depart the Imperial Tomb.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Three years later─",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"As soon as we step outside the car, a sweltering heat washes over me.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"Right now, Tenkyo is in the height of midsummer.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Aaaah... It is far too hot. And this outfit only makes the heat worse...”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Kotone grumbles as she flaps open the collar of her vestment gown.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's indecent, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, please excuse me.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Passersby in the vicinity have already taken notice of\nKotone's arrival and are beginning to gather around us.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Not just Imperials, but quite a few Republicans as well.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Good afternoon, everyone. Thank you for coming out today!”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It would be my pleasure to speak with each and every one of you, so let us make our way to the auditorium!”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Well then, Soujin-sama, I shall be on my way.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Kotone leads the gathered crowd into the nearby auditorium.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...It sure is hot.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"I cool off in the shade as I wait for Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"It's been three years since the Battle for Inner Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Democracy in the Empire has been flourishing, though not without some growing pains.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"Every day, more and more immigrants arrive from the Republic, but Imperials still comprise the overwhelming majority of voters.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"As a consequence, many members of Parliament are Imperials, and a political movement was established to advocate for the restoration of the old Imperial system.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"The Republican faction naturally opposed this, resulting in a parliamentary deadlock that threatened to spiral into a major political crisis.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"But rather than resorting to violence, Governor-General Elsa skillfully managed to defuse the situation through dialogue and diplomacy.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Indeed, the Empire has managed to adapt to democracy faster than all expectations.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Republican Child"},
			{
"“Look, Mommy! It's a real warrior!”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Blonde Woman"},
			{
"“Stop that. He'll cut your head off if you look at him the wrong way.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"The Republican woman hugs her child close, glaring at me like I'm someone dangerous.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"But wholly unconcerned, the child continues to happily wave at me.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"When I wave back, he happily turns around and walks off with his mother.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Even now, there are some Imperials who want to ostracize the Republicans, and some Republicans who want a return to the previous hard-line regime.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"The rift between the two sides runs deep.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"But even so, Elsa and Empress Hisui have been working tirelessly to showcase the strength of their mutual bond to the public.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"And though she'll never admit it, Shino has also been hard at work behind the scenes to improve relations between our two countries.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Sorry to keep you waiting, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No problem. Let's get going.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"As we pick up speed, I roll down the windows, and a refreshing breeze blows into the car.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Haah, what a busy day today has been, with so many people showing up.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Good work out there.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"For her part, Kotone has been regularly organizing a free clinic of sorts.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"In her capacity as a priestess, she counsels Imperials and Republicans alike who are troubled by sickness or injury, going as far as to Heal them with her magicks.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"She had a rough go of things at first.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"Republicans were initially wary of this peculiar Imperial priestess and reluctant to approach her.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"But Kotone being Kotone, she managed to effortlessly ingratiate herself with the Empire's Republican community in no time at all.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Speaking of which, a Republican taught me a new phrase today.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“When your man stubbornly refuses to listen to what you have to say, he apparently ought to be reminded, ≪ladies first!≫”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's that mean?”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It means to always put your woman before yourself!”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I've been told that in the Republic, no man of character would ever place his own needs before that of his better half!”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then I suppose I'm somewhat of a ≪redies faasto≫ man myself, hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hehee, more or less, I suppose.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“More or less?”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"Is my devotion to Kotone somehow lacking?",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"The free clinic that Kotone has been operating this whole time is finally beginning to bear fruit.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"Seeing the Exalt-Priestess herself listen to their concerns and Heal their ails, all without seeking anything in return, eventually instilled in the people an abiding trust.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Nowadays, any priestess walking down the streets of Tenkyo is sure to be met with a chorus of greetings, even from Republicans.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, Soujin-sama! Please stop the car!”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"Before I even come to a full stop, Kotone leaps out and dashes towards the place we just passed.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Are you all right?”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"She peers with concern at the Republican boy who waved at me earlier, accompanied by his distraught mother.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"The child's arm is bleeding from a shallow but jagged cut.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Blonde Woman"},
			{
"“Lady Priestess, my child cut his arm on that hanging wire.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Blonde Woman"},
			{
"“Might you find it in your heart to Heal him?”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But of course!”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“(Surely Kuronushi-no-Ookami would forgive a little magicks of this caliber.)”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"Kotone whispers reverently beneath her breath.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"Then, holding her hands over the child's arm, she murmurs an invocation.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"In the span of a few brief seconds, the cut seals itself completely, replaced by unblemished skin.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Good as new. Be a little more careful next time, all right?”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Republican Child"},
			{
"“Thanks a bunch, Lady Priestess!”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"The child leaps up giddily, expressing his gratitude to Kotone before running off.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"The mother also bows politely to us before following after her child.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"Unlike the steely glare from before, she directs me a kindly smile.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You really are incredible, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ehehee, that was nothing special just now.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“A light injury such as that would have easily healed on its own in due time, but I am still happy to have relieved some of his pain.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"The reason I called her incredible has nothing to do with her magicks.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"But rather, her incredible gift for unlocking the goodness that lies within the hearts of others.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"No matter how many times I've seen it firsthand, it never ceases to amaze me.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"Each time, it reminds me why I fell in love with her in the first place.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, I want to see the ocean.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's make that happen.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"A short while later, we pull up at the beach.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, look, a boat!”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hey, Mister Boat! Have a safe trip!”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"Kotone waves gleefully at a passenger ship out at sea.",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"Squinting my eyes, I can spot several passengers waving back at us.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Soujin-sama, would you hear me out?”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's up?”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Once the free clinic settles down, I would like to board that boat myself.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm, where are you intending to sail to?”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“To the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I wish to found a temple there and teach the Republican people more about the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I believe that if I do so, the Empire and the Republic will be able to get along even better than they are now.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That sounds like an awfully big dream.”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed, I recognize that it sounds like nothing more than a naïve fantasy.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But still... I want to make it a reality.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"Kotone's eyes stare beyond the distant horizon.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"Said by anyone else, I would dismiss such an idea as nonsense.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"But because it's Kotone─",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I believe in you.”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“However, I do have one concern.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If I were to leave for the Republic... what would you do, Soujin-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"As if there was ever any doubt.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd go with you, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Do you truly mean it?!”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, we promised each other, didn't we?”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The two of us will live on together, for as long as we can.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"With her by my side, I would go anywhere.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"With her, I'd even look forward to starting a new life in an unfamiliar land.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank you very much... Soujin-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"Sharing a wide smile, the two of us bask in the warmth of each other's presence.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"Standing side by side, casting our dreams for the future out across the vast sea, we remain there until the ship finally disappears beyond the horizon─",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"─It's been fifty years since that day.",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			{
"On the back of its meteoric growth, the Empire has risen to become the world's second-biggest economy, only behind that of the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"People freely come and go, and after decades of immigration and cultural exchange, there no longer remains any distinction between Republicans and Imperials.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"The world has ceased to talk about us as distinct peoples, as well.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
"The Empire has spread its faith to every corner of the world, establishing temples that serve the local populace and pray for their peace and prosperity.",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			{
"─A world free of discrimination and exclusion.",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"─A world where everyone is loved.",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"All those who share these ideals arrive each and every day to pay their respects at temples across the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"A bright-eyed priestess once declared that she wanted to bring about a kinder world, one where nobody has to shoulder the same sorrows as one Yagi Sekka.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"And that world of hers has indeed been made into reality.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"“Thank you for everything, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			{
"“Having you by my side has been the greatest joy of my life.”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"“Truly, I am the most blessed person in all the world.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"Kotone finally retired as the Exalt-Priestess earlier this year.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"Though priestesses are said to be short-lived, Kotone has persistently clung to life through all these years.",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			{
"─Let us live on together, for as long as we can.",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			{
"Even fifty years later, Kotone has faithfully kept up her promise with me.",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"As for me...",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"Hand in hand with my bride, retired and carefree, I wander the world once more─",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
